sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant A as Attacker
  participant IdP as Identity Provider
  participant D as Victim Device (Push App)
  participant U as User

  A->>IdP: Credential stuffing / password reuse
  IdP-->>D: MFA Push Prompt
  loop Repeated prompts
    IdP-->>D: Push notification
  end
  U->>D: Accidental Approve (fatigue)
  D-->>IdP: Approval signal
  IdP-->>A: Session issued
